      "created_at": "2015-09-29T20:26:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey Sentinels Fans!</p><p>Jean-Marc Giffin here, programmer and music composer at Handelabra Games!</p><p>Not sure if you saw the post yet, but we're celebrating our 1-year anniversary on October 16-18, and part of that will be featuring YOU as arrangers and performers of the Sentinels of the Multiverse Theme Song!</p><p>I've made sheet music, which anyone can download, and you can do whatever you'd like with the music! You can record yourself playing it as-is for the instrument of your choice, or make an entirely new style of it and record that. Whatever you'd like!</p><p>You can get a <a href=\"http://handelabra.com/s/Sentinels_of_the_Multiverse_The_Theme_Song.pdf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">PDF file here</a>, and the <a href=\"http://handelabra.com/s/Sentinels-of-the-Multiverse-Theme-Song.mus\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Finale MUS file here</a>.</p><p>If you're interested, feel free to post in this thread, and then submit your music or video file when it's ready.&nbsp;<span>We'll be sure to highlight and feature the submitters, providing your name and links to your other work (if you have some you'd like to share!)</span></p><p>Hope to hear from you!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
